  "limitations": [
    "This is narrow inherited native callable-API lifetime hardening. No routine production action-removal flow or migration-introduced regression has been established.",
    "The shared native ExtendedAction list weakly tracks each original alternate identity. Finalization clears its pointer and later dispatch skips it. Existing buttons never retarget to same-name replacements. The patch adds no strong dispatch reference and preserves the immediate break after activation, so callback-driven action or owner loss is covered without accessing the retired list again.",
    "The exact original 19 editor assertions and source bytes are preserved. Fourteen new variants cover ordinary/dropdown finalization, replacement identity, precedence, reentrancy, manager loss and retained destroyed buttons. Two old action controls are also selected independently.",
    "Each native and ASan/UBSan final aggregate contains exactly 13 application suites and 520 cases. Each mode adds 16 independent focused executions, for 536 executions per mode. Published protocol12 remains separate and is supported here by unchanged six-binary continuity; it is not a new protocol execution.",
    "Candidate builds require zero new compiler diagnostics. The older DnD build had 111 individually pinned inherited C90 warnings; that history remains unchanged and does not authorize warnings in these candidate builds.",
    "Strict complete-stream diagnostic policy remains in force. Exact source-pinned negative-test output is distinguished from warnings. The older single DnD ASan cancellation notice was consistent with expected cancellation without proven PID attribution; its controls did not reproduce the notice and ptrace was denied. That one-record exception never applies automatically to this candidate.",
    "Native and ordinary address,undefined sanitizer modes retain original assertions, ordinary timeouts and fatal policy. Leak detection is disabled on this host and external GTK/GLib dependencies are not instrumented.",
    "Each GUI process retains the exact six missing desktop-icon notices, one unavailable session-bus notice, one cloud-provider DEBUG line and two disabled virtual-device notices. Those desktop integrations remain unvalidated. The separate 1191 shipped widget-icon assets and 93 source profile/gradient assets are byte-sealed.",
    "Fresh header gates verify 369 existing compiled probes, 16 route controls and 18 icon-generator controls in each mode. Existing C11/C++14 orientation objects each verify 12 signatures, and new links bind them to the successor compact executable. Eight unchanged defined ELF/export-table symbols do not establish Windows linkage, GIR or bitmap-build/golden-raster parity.",
    "This is an internal lifetime repair. Visual material is optional and remains outside this publication package; no screenshot sharing is an acceptance gate. No visual redesign, visual parity or new user-facing feature delivery is claimed.",
    "All 93 original 08.017 rows remain TODO. The 140/661 original task count, protected histogram/shaded-dock/provider obligations and sibling duties are unchanged. Publication does not complete all93 reconciliation or mark the migration task done."
  ],
